This declaration does not need to be part of a declare section; that is, you can also write typedefs as
normal C statements. Any word you declare as a typedef cannot be used as an SQL keyword in EXEC SQL commands later
in the same program.

For example, this won't work:
EXEC SQL BEGIN DECLARE SECTION;
